  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Changes needed: Update the httpcomponents httpclient, httpmime, and httpcore dependencies to a version that is at least version 4.4+",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Reasoning: The work being done to allow Fedora to write to S3 [1] uses the latest AWS Java SDK, which has a dependency on methods added to the httpcomponent set in version 4.4 [2]. The simplest way to accommodate this and avoid multiple versions of the same jar would be to update the versions of the existing Fedora dependencies.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "[1] ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-webapp-plus-cloud"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-webapp-plus-cloud",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "[2] ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-client-ga/httpclient/apidocs/org/apache/http/conn/ssl/SSLConnectionSocketFactory.html"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-client-ga/httpclient/apidocs/org/apache/http/conn/ssl/SSLConnectionSocketFactory.html",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
