  "description": "<p>Changes needed: Update the httpcomponents httpclient, httpmime, and httpcore dependencies to a version that is at least version 4.4+</p>\n\n<p>Reasoning: The work being done to allow Fedora to write to S3 <span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> uses the latest AWS Java SDK, which has a dependency on methods added to the httpcomponent set in version 4.4 <span class=\"error\">&#91;2&#93;</span>. The simplest way to accommodate this and avoid multiple versions of the same jar would be to update the versions of the existing Fedora dependencies.</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-webapp-plus-cloud\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-webapp-plus-cloud</a><br/>\n<span class=\"error\">&#91;2&#93;</span> <a href=\"https://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-client-ga/httpclient/apidocs/org/apache/http/conn/ssl/SSLConnectionSocketFactory.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://hc.apache.org/httpcomponents-client-ga/httpclient/apidocs/org/apache/http/conn/ssl/SSLConnectionSocketFactory.html</a></p>",
